            "source:f5f4d41783bf3fcc7e4b0db0"
          ],
          "text": "A Vekniss soldier is a hostile insectoid found among the Vekniss of Ahn’Qiraj. In combat it can call Agro Drones, making it a dangerous part of the hive’s defenses.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15229
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
