            "source:11eff8592277c4159658c56d",
            "source:dec62f9b5f32eade836848dd",
            "source:5b4aac36aa44af720fdb8332"
          ],
          "text": "A Vekniss guardian is a hostile insectoid stationed among the Vekniss of Ahn’Qiraj. It can emit a strange noise and become enraged, then attack with Impale.",
          "when": {
