          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15378,
      "name": "Merithra of the Dream",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15378:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ab4be1069411471b1623f95e",
            "source:40028dc3491235035a1797d6",
            "source:de0fd6dfa1ba90caca62b6e2"
          ],
          "text": "Merithra vows to hold the enemy back while Anachronos seals the barrier, urging him not to falter. She calls on foes to succumb to the endless dream.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15378
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15379,
      "name": "Caelestrasz",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15379:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:1e20602256b65ea60bdc6c81",
            "source:6e590b62a31aa3b378b8dfb4",
            "source:5804988addd65679cbd0d45e",
            "source:0b11d7f81d3836e883a60072"
          ],
          "text": "Caelestrasz is a dragon who counsels Fandral to keep grief from turning into vengeance, warning that absolution cannot come through it. He remembers the suffering the Qiraji have inflicted and calls on the champions to remember the sacrifices made in the fight. He remains wary of C'Thun's evil and says the dragons will leave only once they are sure it is wholly destroyed.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15379
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15380,
      "name": "Arygos",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15380:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ad82f91ce5432f1ae10ee39d",
            "source:0573a6b9e5d1090b49c1e471",
            "source:f379d7c5cf323c783f0fdc42"
          ],
          "text": "Arygos is a dragon of the Blue Flight who takes part in the effort to seal the barrier. He draws the Qiraji's attention to give Anachronos and a young druid time, then faces the enemy with confidence in his flight's power. He argues that Elementium, born from conflict between the Old Gods and their minions, can be turned against them, and offers to infuse weapons for the fight.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15380
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15502,
      "name": "Andorgos",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15502:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:12ded4ee6bd2c30d2324c33f",
            "source:5c35563ffbf8a0392e81cc92",
            "source:75f314ef5aa046738a81a95e"
          ],
          "text": "Andorgos is a dragon of the Brood of Malygos, troubled by the Twin Emperors’ whispers and unable to enter their domain to rescue his brother Arygos. He seeks revenge by transmuting the emperors’ crowns into powerful headpieces for his allies. After their magical protection is weakened, he can translocate others to their lair.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15502
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Brood of Malygos"
    },
    {
      "entry": 15503,
      "name": "Kandrostrasz",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15503:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:fcf8468384a15c3eb3327530",
            "source:eb7ccc9662612729fb7196de",
            "source:b991a8384bb172ffcfef801e",
            "source:d4374e977ba2c0d90389f34b",
            "source:96d321b226220b8ab040c563",
            "source:233e8e9353a1480aa7474b96",
            "source:9d4d84753ca3d50c2d1a5d27",
            "source:524873351e9f2e09812e1ac2"
          ],
          "text": "Kandrostrasz is of the Brood of Alexstrasza, one of the kin who came to Ahn'Qiraj after the Scarab Wall fell. His kin had vowed to seek Merithra, Arygos, and Caelestrasz if the wall ever fell. He also makes class-specific armor from Qiraji and other materials, hoping it will help adventurers face the enemy and the horrors within.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15503
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Brood of Alexstrasza"
    },
    {
      "entry": 15504,
      "name": "Vethsera",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15504:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:94c55524ed7f971737384ec7",
            "source:0fd774e83d38e5ab748f025b"
          ],
          "text": "Vethsera serves the Brood of Ysera in Ahn’Qiraj. She warns that C’Thun and its worshippers threaten Azeroth, and says her allies returned under an oath to Merithra, Caelestrasz and Arygos. She is resolved to stop C’Thun, framing their return as both a pledge to their kin and a response to the danger he poses.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15504
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Brood of Ysera"
    },
    {
      "entry": 15510,
      "name": "Fankriss the Unyielding",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15510:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:aa9d99e24f343273ebb3fae2",
            "source:edff446fc23e791cd9037ab6"
          ],
          "text": "Fankriss the Unyielding is a boss whose spoils can include a Qiraji Lord’s Insignia.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15510
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15516,
      "name": "Battleguard Sartura",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:15516:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:dc388674957645e6b3725689",
            "source:64494eecf16aa9ff489d9406",
            "source:1f8e148ba9b5cb95683e734c",
            "source:01391f29602fbd2c0625613c"
          ],
          "text": "Battleguard Sartura guards the sacred grounds under the laws of the Ancients. She condemns trespassers, vows to judge and annihilate them, and declares that she serves to the last.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15516
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 15544,
      "name": "Vem",
